- generic: Cell(Int) and Cell(String) constructed in separate ordinary scopes and captured in different services; passed. This verifies ordinary language behavior, not future provider graph instantiation.
- rebinding: captured Target vs call-site Target gives (1,2); passed.
- bootstrap: fixed prefix retains Config requirement, dependencies-first removes it; corrected wrapper passed.

No compiler rebuild, future provider implementation, generated JS target or R2 execution was claimed. Reviewed worktree remained clean.
